From: openEuler RISC-V packaging
Subject: [PATCH] Stamp the exported CMake package as release 1.0.5

The official v1.0.5 source still declares project VERSION 1.0.0.
Update only that declaration so find_package(concurrentqueue 1.0.5 EXACT)
can validate the release actually packaged. No implementation/test changes.
Represent the unchanged empty line explicitly to retain trailing context
without adding a whitespace-only context line to this committed patch.
Upstream status: packaging-local version metadata correction; not submitted.
Removal condition: upstream project VERSION matches the packaged stable tag.
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.9)
-project(concurrentqueue VERSION 1.0.0)
+project(concurrentqueue VERSION 1.0.5)
-
+
 include(GNUInstallDirs)
 include(CMakePackageConfigHelpers)
